evidence/**
!evidence/*/
!evidence/*/report.json
# \SINGLE-CLOCK-SWITCH-02\ — a campaign is now a DIRECTORY OF RUNS (one per measured pair), so the
# report of record sits one level deeper. The recordings themselves stay ignored; only the numbers
# are committed, which is the same rule one nesting level along.
!evidence/*/*/
!evidence/*/*/report.json

# SKEW-INTERSECT-01 — the owner's own template (`3-ghab.vcg` / `.cgproj` and the photograph it
# carries). Undiffable binary, one of them a picture of a person, and re-exportable from his
# Designer at any time. What the harness needs from it is the SHAPE, which is committed in
# `src/geometry.ts` as `GHAB_FIXTURE`. See `fixtures/README.md` for the whole decision.
fixtures/owner/**
